```m
#"Fixed Date" = Table.TransformColumns(
    #"Previous Step",
    {{"order_date", each
        try Date.FromText(_, [Format="yyyy-MM-dd", Culture="en-IN"])
        otherwise Date.FromText(_, [Format="dd-MM-yyyy", Culture="en-IN"]),
      type date}}
)
```

Because the format is given explicitly, `01-01-2023` is read as 1 January and `05-03-2023` is read as 5 March, not 3 May. Letting Power Query guess (or using the US locale) swaps day and month for ambiguous values.
